# GNOME Shell compatibility map for the gnome-extensions module (P6.3).
# Format per line: <extension-uuid>|<min-shell-major>|<max-shell-major>
# Lines are report-only hints: when the probed GNOME Shell major falls
# outside a line's window AND that uuid is installed, the module emits a
# compatibility warning (io_warn). Missing or partially-malformed lines are
# dropped; the map is never authoritative and never blocks a run. Keep this
# in sync with the distro-packaged versions declared in
# modules/gnome-extensions/packages.<family>.list and with the curated
# enable set in modules/gnome-extensions/extensions.list.
# Windows below were reviewed against GNOME Shell 50 (Fedora 44, Sep 2026);
# treat as house-maintained estimates, not distro release data.
dash-to-dock@micxgx.gmail.com|45|50
user-theme@gnome-shell-extensions.gcampax.github.com|50|50
